"""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""
" System-wide vim configuration (deployed to /etc/vim/vimrc.local)
"
" Author: Acheson, Douglas WF (dwfa@dwfa.ca)
"
" Copyright 2022 Douglas WF Acheson (dwfa@dwfa.ca)
